      <p>Bengaluru combines large IT parks and data centres with manufacturing hubs such as Peenya, Bommasandra, Jigani and Whitefield, where electronics, aerospace, machine-tool and pharmaceutical companies operate. Projects here often demand energy-efficient, low-noise air handling for offices alongside robust ventilation for production floors.</p>
      <p>Every unit is built at our factory in Neemrana, Rajasthan and selected to suit the required airflow, static pressure and site conditions of your project. Our team can help with sizing and technical data before you order, and we dispatch finished equipment to sites across Bengaluru and the rest of India.</p>
      <p class="loc-seo__cta">To get a quotation for Inline Fans in Bengaluru, share your airflow, pressure and application details through our <a href="../contact.php" title="Contact Fan Air India">contact page</a>, call <a href="tel:+919811347199" title="Call Fan Air India">+91-9811347199</a> or email <a href="mailto:saurabh.joshi@fanair.in" title="Email Fan Air India">saurabh.joshi@fanair.in</a>.</p>
